cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its claim ledger, please cite it as below."
title: "llm-claims-lab: A reproducible audit of practitioner LLM claims, 20 months later"
authors:
  - name: "llm-claims-lab contributors"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://example.invalid/llm-claims-lab"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline that verifies the material claims of a widely cited
  practitioner video ("How I use LLMs", February 2025) against primary sources,
  live market data (2026), and public benchmark datasets, with preregistered
  protocols for the parts that require model access.
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - LLM evaluation
  - temporal validity
  - benchmark audit
  - open data
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-17"
